são entre dois números. \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nResolução:def calculadora(): \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    num1 = float(input(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Digite o primeiro número: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")) \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    operador = input(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Digite o operador (+, -, *, /): \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    num2 = float(input(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Digite o segundo número: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")) \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    if operador == '+': \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n        print(f\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Resultado: {num1 + num2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    elif operador == '-': \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n        print(f\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Resultado: {num1 - num2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    elif operador == '*': \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n        print(f\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Resultado: {num1 * num2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    elif operador == '/': \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n        if num2 ! 0 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n            print(f\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Resultado: {num1 / num2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n        else: \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n            print(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Erro: Divisão por zero não é permitida.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    else: \\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n        print(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Operador inválido.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\ncalculadora()\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":142,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":186,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.info.Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Skia/PDF m139 Google Docs Renderer\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.info.Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lista de Exercícios de Programação em Python\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.totalPages\\\\\\\":6,\\\\\\\"pdf.version\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.10.100\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"03fcbd0d-ce51-4261-82b7-cb834b6c284a\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lista de Exercícios de Programação \\\\\\\\nem Python Básico ao \\\\\\\\nIntermediário) \\\\\\\\nEsta lista de exercícios tem como objetivo testar e aprimorar seus \\\\\\\\nconhecimentos em Python, abrangendo tópicos desde o básico até o \\\\\\\\nintermediário. Cada questão inclui uma resolução para que você possa \\\\\\\\nverificar seu entendimento. \\\\\\\\nQuestões \\\\\\\\n1. Olá Mundo! \\\\\\\\nQuestão: Escreva um programa que imprima \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Olá, Mundo!\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" na tela. \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nResolução:print(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Olá, Mundo!\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n2. Soma de Dois Números \\\\\\\\nQuestão: Peça ao usuário para inserir dois números inteiros e imprima a soma \\\\\\\\ndeles. \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nResolução:num1 = int(input(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Digite o primeiro número: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")) \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nnum2 = int(input(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Digite o segundo número: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")) \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nsoma = num1 + num2 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nprint(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"A soma é:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", soma)\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":2,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":24,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.info.Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Skia/PDF m139 Google Docs Renderer\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.info.Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lista de Exercícios de Programação em Python\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.totalPages\\\\\\\":6,\\\\\\\"pdf.version\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.10.100\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0115eca3-75c2-4e39-b5af-dc4a8683b0be\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"3. Par ou Ímpar \\\\\\\\nQuestão: Peça ao usuário para inserir um número inteiro e determine se ele é \\\\\\\\npar ou ímpar. \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nResolução:num = int(input(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Digite um número: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")) \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nif num % 2 == 0 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"O número é par.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nelse: \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"O número é ímpar.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n4. Maior de Três Números \\\\\\\\nQuestão: Peça ao usuário para inserir três números e imprima o maior deles. \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nResolução:num1 = int(input(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Digite o primeiro número: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")) \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nnum2 = int(input(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Digite o segundo número: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")) \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nnum3 = int(input(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Digite o terceiro número: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")) \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nif num1 >= num2 and num1 >= num3 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"O maior número é:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", num1 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nelif num2 >= num1 and num2 >= num3 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"O maior número é:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", num2 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nelse: \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"O maior número é:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", num3 \\\\\\\\n5. Tabuada \\\\\\\\nQuestão: Peça ao usuário para inserir um número e imprima a tabuada desse \\\\\\\\nnúmero de 1 a 10.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":26,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":61,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.info.Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Skia/PDF m139 Google Docs Renderer\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.info.Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lista de Exercícios de Programação em Python\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.totalPages\\\\\\\":6,\\\\\\\"pdf.version\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.10.100\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"878d5fc2-9355-4a20-968b-70df2c319283\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Resolução:num = int(input(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Digite um número para ver a tabuada: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")) \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nfor i in range(1, 11 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    print(f\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"{num} x {i} = {num * i}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n6. Fatorial \\\\\\\\nQuestão: Escreva uma função que calcule o fatorial de um número inteiro \\\\\\\\npositivo. \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nResolução:def fatorial(n): \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    if n == 0 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n        return 1 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    else: \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n        res = 1 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n        for i in range(1, n + 1 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n            res *= i \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n        return res \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nnum = int(input(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Digite um número para calcular o fatorial: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")) \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nif num < 0 \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Não é possível calcular o fatorial de um número negativo.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\nelse: \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\n    print(f\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"O fatorial de {num} é {fatorial(num)}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") \\\\\\\\n7. Verificador de Palíndromo \\\\\\\\nQuestão: Escreva uma função que verifique se uma palavra ou frase é um \\\\\\\\npalíndromo (lê-se da mesma forma de trás para frente).\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":64,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":100,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"pdf.info.PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.info.Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Skia/PDF m139 Google Docs Renderer\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.info.Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lista de Exercícios de Programação em Python\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf.totalPages\\\\\\\":6,\\\\\\\"pdf.version\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.10.100\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"84ce07d6-d3ec-403c-8766-a379e40c9529\\\\\\\"}\\\"}]}]\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"gpt-4.1-nano\",\"timeout\":60000,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://api.openai.com/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{}},\"model_kwargs\":{},\"use_responses_api\":true},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"O exercício 4 pede para criar um programa que peça ao usuário para inserir três números e depois imprima o maior deles. Para fazer isso de forma clara, podemos seguir os seguintes passos:\\n\\n1. **Pedir ao usuário que insira três números**: utilizamos a função `input()` para capturar o que o usuário digita. Como estamos lidando com números inteiros, vamos converter a entrada de texto para inteiro com `int()`.\\n\\n2. **Comparar os números para encontrar o maior**: existem várias formas, mas uma das mais claras é usar condicionais (`if`, `elif`, `else`).  \\n   - Primeiro, verificamos se o primeiro número é maior ou igual aos outros dois. Se for, ele é o maior.  \\n   - Se não for, verificamos se o segundo número é maior ou igual ao terceiro. Se for, ele é o maior.  \\n   - Caso contrário, o terceiro número será o maior.\\n\\n3. **Imprimir o resultado**, mostrando qual número é o maior.\\n\\nSegue um exemplo de como esse programa ficaria em Python:\\n\\n```python\\n# Pedir ao usuário que insira os três números\\nnum1 = int(input(\\\"Digite o primeiro número: \\\"))\\nnum2 = int(input(\\\"Digite o segundo número: \\\"))\\nnum3 = int(input(\\\"Digite o terceiro número: \\\"))\\n\\n# Verificar qual é o maior\\nif num1 >= num2 and num1 >= num3:\\n    print(\\\"O maior número é:\\\", num1)\\nelif num2 >= num1 and num2 >= num3:\\n    print(\\\"O maior número é:\\\", num2)\\nelse:\\n    print(\\\"O maior número é:\\\", num3)\\n```\\n\\nSe quiser, posso te ajudar a entender cada parte desse código com mais detalhes ou fazer alguma adaptação específica.\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":366,\"promptTokens\":2078,\"totalTokens\":2444}}}"}}
